<title>GREECE: GREEK, ARMENIAN INDUSTRY UNIONS SIGN MEMO OF COOPERATION.</title>
<headline>GREEK, ARMENIAN INDUSTRY UNIONS SIGN MEMO OF COOPERATION.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Armenian Union of Industrialists and Entrepreneurs and the Federation of Greek Industries (SEV) signed a memo of cooperation on Friday, SEV said in a statement.</p>
<p>The memo was signed by SEV's chairman, Iason Stratos and the chairman of the Armenian Union, Aram Vardanyan, it added. --Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
